{
  "summary": "The change implements support for [MessagePackObject(SuppressSourceGeneration = true)] by modifying TypeCollector.cs to properly report contract diagnostics (missing [Key], duplicate keys, mixed key kinds) for suppressed types while suppressing formatter-generation-only diagnostics (partial-class requirement, AOT-only checks). The fix adds duplicate-key checks before adding members to dictionaries, preventing AD0001 analyzer crashes that occurred on invalid contracts for suppressed types.",
  "requirement_verdicts": [
    {"req": "REQ-2234-F1", "verdict": "met", "confidence_basis": "The 4 targeted tests that fail without the fix (DuplicateIntKeysAreReportedWithoutAnalyzerFailure, DuplicateStringKeysAreReportedWithoutAnalyzerFailure, MixedKeyKindsAreReportedWithoutAnalyzerFailure, DuplicateKeysAreReportedWithoutAnalyzerFailureForGeneratedTypes) all expect and now receive contract diagnostics for SuppressSourceGeneration=true types; without the fix they crash with AD0001 instead of reporting the expected MsgPack005 diagnostics. The other 4 new tests (MemberWithoutKeyIsReported, AllowPrivateRequiredIsReported, MemberTypeMustBeMessagePackObjectIsReported, SourceGenerationOnlyDiagnosticsAreNotReportedWhenSuppressed) pass both with and without the fix, confirming the analyzer correctly validates contract rules and skips formatter-only diagnostics.",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "test", "name": "SuppressSourceGenerationAnalyzerTests.DuplicateIntKeysAreReportedWithoutAnalyzerFailure", "outcome": "passed", "check": "tests.targeted"}, {"kind": "test", "name": "SuppressSourceGenerationAnalyzerTests.DuplicateStringKeysAreReportedWithoutAnalyzerFailure", "outcome": "passed", "check": "tests.targeted"}, {"kind": "test", "name": "SuppressSourceGenerationAnalyzerTests.MixedKeyKindsAreReportedWithoutAnalyzerFailure", "outcome": "passed", "check": "tests.targeted"}, {"kind": "test", "name": "SuppressSourceGenerationAnalyzerTests.DuplicateKeysAreReportedWithoutAnalyzerFailureForGeneratedTypes", "outcome": "passed", "check": "tests.targeted"}, {"kind": "check", "id": "tests.fail_without_fix", "status": "pass", "summary": "4/8 new tests fail without the fix, confirming they cover the change; 4 pass without fix"}]
    },
    {"req": "REQ-2234-F2", "verdict": "met", "confidence_basis": "The test SourceGenerationOnlyDiagnosticsAreNotReportedWhenSuppressed passes, and the code at TypeCollector.cs line 1383-1387 explicitly returns null (skipping source generation) when suppressSourceGeneration is true, preventing MsgPack011/016/017 diagnostics from being reported for suppressed types.",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "test", "name": "SuppressSourceGenerationAnalyzerTests.SourceGenerationOnlyDiagnosticsAreNotReportedWhenSuppressed", "outcome": "passed", "check": "tests.targeted"}, {"kind": "code", "file": "src/MessagePack.SourceGenerator/CodeAnalysis/TypeCollector.cs", "line": "1383", "rev": "head", "quote": "if (suppressSourceGeneration is true) { // Skip any source generation return null; }"}]
    },
